    "body": "claimed: main session (2e63b5e4) agent · 2026-11-07T22:50Z · worktree ../cc-issue128, branch issue/128-mcp-server from origin/main · plan (first slice): `camcraft-cli mcp`, a stdio MCP server over the existing headless/script API. Tools: open/import a model, inspect the job (setups, stock, tools, operations and params as JSON), list op types and param schemas, add/edit/delete an op (through the command history, so undo works), generate, verify (findings as data), post to a file. Every mutating tool goes through commands, and errors come back as tool errors, never panics. Screenshots and fixtures follow later.",
