    "body": "first slice committed locally: 518d1af on issue/128-mcp-server (not pushed yet) · `camcraft-cli mcp`, a stdio MCP server (JSON-RPC 2.0; MCP 2025-06-18, with 2025-03-26 and 2024-11-05 negotiated).\n\nTools: open_project, save_project, import_model, get_job, list_operation_types, list_tool_catalog, add_tool, set_stock, add_operation, edit_operation (a JSON merge patch through EditOperationParams), delete_operation, set_tool, undo, redo, generate, verify (findings as data: op, move, kind, message, blocks_post), post (returns the written files or the refusal). Every write goes through the command History. Every refusal is a tool error.\n\nPinned by tests/mcp.rs (4 tests). cli and scripting suites green; clippy -D warnings clean on camcraft-app.\n\nOwed parts, filed: #180 (face/edge/loop picks), #181 (WCS/machine/fixtures), #182 (sim render and screenshots), #183 (server mode inside the GUI). This issue stays open for them.\n",
